Bandook Meri Laila guitar chords with strumming pattern from Bollywood movie A Gentleman sung by Ash King, Sidharth Malhotra, Raftaar and Jigar Saraiya.

[F#m]Haaye haaye haaye

Tu aise [E]aaye aaye aaye

[F#m]Meri aankhon mein explode kardi ae [A]

[F#m]Dhayein dhayein dhayein

Dil ko [E]udaye aaye aaye

Mere [F#m]khwabon ko reload kardi [A]ae

O seene [D]mein tune

Bullet [E]utaari toh

Ude jugnoo [F#m] haan ude jugnoo [x2]

[A]Le gayi [D] dil ko kudi tu [E]shikari

Bana [F#m]Majnu main, bana Majnu [D] [x2]

[A]Bandook meri [D]Laila..[E][F#m] [x2]

[D]Ban meri Laila

Ban ban meri Laila

[E]Ban meri Laila

Ban ban meri Laila

[F#m]Ban meri Laila

Ban ban meri Laila

Rest are same as above

Main hoon nishana

Bandook meri Laila..

(Sidharth Malhotra)

Kudi tu lage Beretta ki beti

Tenu vekheya te khinch gayi peti

Tere liye kha loon seene pe goli

Phir kyun tu mujhko hi goli deti
